 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## Publishing a board
+
+`public_url` is `null` until an admin publishes the board. Publishing gives anyone with the secret URL read-only access; unpublishing revokes that URL. Publishing an unpublished board again generates a new key.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board. Only account admins can perform this action. Returns `201 Created` with the board JSON, including its `public_url`, for JSON requests.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board. Only account admins can perform this action. Returns `204 No Content` for JSON requests.
+
+## Public board URLs
+
+These endpoints do not require authentication. A key is only valid while its board is published.
+
+- `GET /public/boards/:key` opens the published board.
+- `GET /public/boards/:key/columns/:id` opens a column from that board.
+- `GET /public/boards/:key/cards/:number` opens a published card from that board. Draft cards are not exposed.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
